        // DiskPE, the Embedded PDB Entry can be read from process memory at this RVA. If the
        // DkmModuleMemoryLayout of the DkmModule is Unknown and the
        // DkmModuleFlag::FileResolved flag is set, the Embedded PDB entry can be read from
        // the module file on disk at this address.
